{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:53 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:53 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:53 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05bdb4735664f653509adfcc85011cf3/2026-10/Sir_1_.jpg\"/><p>一連三日的重陽節假期來到尾聲，入境處預計今日下午至晚上會是入境香港的高峰期。入境處落馬洲管制科副指揮官容嘉蔚呼籲旅客避免於繁忙時段過關，合資格使用「合作查驗」的市民，可預先於入境處e-道流動應用程序進行登記。出行前，亦可使用保安局「口岸通」平台查看實時過關人流。</p><p>容嘉蔚又指，現時皇崗口岸離境和入境大堂都十分暢順。</p><img alt=\"入境處落馬洲管制科副指揮官容嘉蔚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4092d8813b0234c27fd67ad5a82a19f2/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-19-14h48m27s758.png\"/><img alt=\"現時皇崗口岸離境和入境大堂都十分暢順。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b50c06b31155d4990f5503dd7fa84139/2026-10/Sir_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現時皇崗口岸離境和入境大堂都十分暢順。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df91300cc9f775f7cbb782b29b438948/2026-10/Sir_1__0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4411cfe2d2b05e678c3f326452b9b55c/2026-10/NH261017WK60.jpg\"/><img alt=\"入境處呼籲合資格使用「合作查驗」的市民，可預先於入境處e-道流動應用程序進行登記。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7191c3f722bf1c2536497bb094d90cf8/2026-10/44_11.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T06:59:00.920443+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:53:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T06:57:37.696579+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:57:37.696579+00:00","content_hash":"945e2e3071ccfa8182ca668d47476c2cd03d646b272493af1277b4634a60f934","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}